.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt WHAT 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm what
.Nd extract SCCS identification strings
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl s
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility scans each file for the SCCS marker
.Li @(#)
and writes the marker string up to a quote, greater-than sign, newline or
NUL.
The
.Fl s
option stops after the first string in each file.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success; a file error returns 1 and a usage error 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr unget 1
